{"id":"lesson-1710","topicId":1710,"title":"第六单元","sourceTitle":"第六单元","blockId":"bixiu-shang","blockTitle":"必修上","forumUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/t/topic/1710","createdAt":"2024-08-21T12:17:49Z","updatedAt":"2024-08-21T12:17:49Z","postCount":1,"excerpt":"学习是永恒的话题。从《礼记·学记》中的“玉 不琢,不成器”,到当今社会倡导的终身学习和个性 化学习,数千年来,人们一直在不懈地探索学习之道, 以更好地获取知识,提升能力和自身修养。 本单元的文章从不同角度论述有关学习的问题, 或阐述学习的意义,或讨论学习的态度与方法,或描 述读书的经历与感受,使我们获得不同的启迪。 学习本单元,以“学习之道”为核心,通过梳理、 探究和反思,形成正确的学习观,改进学习方法,提 高学习能力。要准确把握作者的观点和态度,关注作 者思考问题的角度,学习他们有针对性地表达观点的 方法;学会发现问题,从合适的角度以恰当的方式阐 述自己的看法。","textbook":{"bookId":"高中_语文_普通高中教科书_语文必修_上册","bookTitle":"普通高中教科书·语文必修 上册（人教版）","imageBase":"https://img.rdfzer.com/pages/1082bfb4a71a","tocLabel":"第六单元","tocScore":1.11,"startPage":89,"pages":[89],"pageImages":[{"page":89,"src":"https://img.rdfzer.com/pages/1082bfb4a71a/p89.webp","label":"p89","matched":true}],"contextPages":[69,70,71,72,73,74,75,76,77,78,79,80,81,82,83,84,85,86,87,88,89,90,91,92,93,94,95,96,97,98,99,100,101,102,103,104,105,106,107,108,109],"contextPageImages":[{"page":69,"src":"https://img.rdfzer.com/pages/1082bfb4a71a/p69.webp","label":"p69","matched":false},{"page":70,"src":"https://img.rdfzer.com/pages/1082bfb4a71a/p70.webp","label":"p70","matched":false},{"page":71,"src":"https://img.rdfzer.com/pages/1082bfb4a71a/p71.webp","label":"p71","matched":false},{"page":72,"src":"https://img.rdfzer.com/pages/1082bfb4a71a/p72.webp","label":"p72","matched":false},{"page":73,"src":"https://img.rdfzer.com/pages/1082bfb4a71a/p73.webp","label":"p73","matched":false},{"page":74,"src":"https://img.rdfzer.com/pages/1082bfb4a71a/p74.webp","label":"p74","matched":false},{"page":75,"src":"https://img.rdfzer.com/pages/1082bfb4a71a/p75.webp","label":"p75","matched":false},{"page":76,"src":"https://img.rdfzer.com/pages/1082bfb4a71a/p76.webp","label":"p76","matched":false},{"page":77,"src":"https://img.rdfzer.com/pages/1082bfb4a71a/p77.webp","label":"p77","matched":false},{"page":78,"src":"https://img.rdfzer.com/pages/1082bfb4a71a/